<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n67179" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετοικ-έω</span></b> , 
			Locr.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεταϝοικέω</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			<u>IG</u>
			9
		</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
			1
		</span></i>).<i><span class="en">
			333.6
		</span></i>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>change one's
				abode, remove to</i> a place, c. acc. loci, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hipp.</u>
				837
			</span></i> (lyr.): c. dat. loci, <i>settle in</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				9.83
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> abs., <i>to
				be a settler, reside in a foreign city,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
			</span></i> l.c., etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς μετοικοῦντας ξένους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					892
				</span></i>
			; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολιτεύεσθαι</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				12.20
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. γῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					609
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. ἐν τῇ πόλει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lys.
					5.2
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν Μιλήτῳ ἔτη πέντε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					633.60
				</span></i>
			 (Milet., <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταύτῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Av.</u>
					1319
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀθήνῃσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					49.26
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρ᾽ ἑτέροις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Isoc.
					<u>Ep.</u>
					8.4
				</span></i>
			.</div>
